---
/**
 * The Lab's closing band: one sentence and one link to /contact/, under the
 * wall and under the List. It sits after the page's .lab-page section, never
 * inside it: the wall is that section's last grid row and fills the window
 * on its own. Quiet on purpose, like the closer on the business pages: no
 * label above it, no icon, no tracked capitals. The words are the founder's
 * to edit.
 */
---
<section class="lab-contact">
  <div class="wrap band">
    <p class="ask">Want something like this for your business?</p>
    <a class="more-link talk" href="/contact/">Talk to us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lab-contact { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .band {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline;
    column-gap: var(--space-4); row-gap: var(--space-2);
    padding-block: var(--space-6);
  }
  .ask { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-xl); line-height: 1.25; }
  .talk { font-size: var(--text-base); }
</style>
